      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence finds sponsor reads and commercials, so Hearth can skip them automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence findet Sponsorenblöcke und Werbespots, damit Hearth sie automatisch überspringen kann."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence is still being set up. Until then, ads are found by typical phrases." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence wird noch eingerichtet. Bis dahin wird Werbung an typischen Formulierungen erkannt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence reads the transcript and finds sponsor reads, commercials and promo codes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence liest das Transkript und findet Sponsorenblöcke, Werbespots und Rabattcodes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's speech recognition writes down every word with its exact time, so the transcript follows along while you listen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Spracherkennung von Apple schreibt jedes Wort mit seinem genauen Zeitpunkt mit – so läuft das Transkript beim Hören mit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio and transcript never leave this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
